=== Keyboard Shortcuts ===
── Navigation ──
  ↑/k                 Move up in the list, chat, menu or help
  ↓/j                 Move down in the list, chat, menu or help
  PgUp                Move up one page
  PgDn                Move down one page
  Home/g              Go to the top
  End/G               Go to the end; in the chat, back to live
  Enter               Open the highlighted item
  Tab                 Switch between the list and the chat
  Esc                 Go back one level; from a search, to where it began
  Ctrl+R              Go to the top of the live categories from anywhere
  f                   Favorite the channel or pin the category; again to undo
  x                   Remove the highlighted channel from recents
  X                   Clear every recent on the list, after confirming
  On a question in the bar:
    y                 Answer yes
    Esc/n             Answer no; nothing changes
── Search and filters ──
  /                   Filter the list
  Ctrl+F/S            Search categories and channels
  Ctrl+K              Open Quick open
  l                   Open the language and audience filters
  In the search prompt:
    Enter Ctrl+F/S    Search for what you typed
    Esc               Cancel the search
  In the / filter:
    ↑/↓ PgUp PgDn     Move through the list while typing
    Enter             Open the highlighted item or, when nothing matches, search for the text
    Esc               Clear and close the filter
    Ctrl+F/S          Search the platform for the filter text
  In Quick open:
    Enter             Open the highlighted result or search with the text
    Esc Ctrl+K        Close Quick open
  In the filter menu:
    ↑/k ↓/j PgUp PgDn Home/g End/G
                      Move through the options
    Enter Space       Turn the option on or off
